SABRE Personal Safety commands the greatest share of the global bear‑spray market, thanks to a vertically integrated supply chain that couples in‑house formulation with a worldwide dealer network. The company’s flagship “SABRE Bear Spray” line benefits from patents covering nozzle geometry and capsaicinoid concentration, delivering a measurable performance premium in third‑party field tests. Aggressive marketing through national‑park agencies and outdoor retailers has locked in long‑term contracts that cement SABRE’s leadership position. Margins sit toward the top of the industry range (30‑50 %), enabling investment in incremental product upgrades such as compact “mini‑spray” formats and environmentally‑friendly packaging.
